{"alta-263":{"title":"The Man in the Raincoat","mood":"A stranger's rage arrives out of nowhere on a quiet street, and there is nothing to answer it with.","world":{"sky":"dusk","skyColor":"#5a6078","horizonColor":"#bd8a6a","fogColor":"#6c7084","fogDensity":0.009,"ground":"stone","groundColor":"#5c5e63","ambient":"#454a66","sunColor":"#e0a878","sunIntensity":0.75,"sunDir":[-0.4,0.6,0.5],"weather":"none","stars":false},"actors":[{"id":"me","kind":"person","label":"me","color":"#4a6f9c","size":1,"pos":[0,0,-6],"yaw":0,"detail":{"skin":"#e0b48c","hair":"#4a3a2c"}},{"id":"man_raincoat","kind":"person","label":"the loud man in a raincoat","color":"#6a6258","size":1.1,"pos":[0,0,10.9],"yaw":180,"hidden":true,"detail":{"wear":"raincoat","wearColor":"#3d4a3a","skin":"#d8ac86","hair":"#332b24"}},{"id":"watchers","kind":"crowd","label":"some people out watching","color":"#70747e","size":1,"pos":[7,0,4],"yaw":285,"hidden":true,"detail":{"count":3,"radius":2.5}},{"id":"the_street","kind":"road","label":"the street","color":"#4e5054","size":1,"pos":[0,0,-10],"yaw":0,"detail":{"width":8,"depth":120}},{"id":"the_corner","kind":"road","label":"the corner","color":"#4e5054","size":1,"pos":[0,0,16],"yaw":90,"detail":{"width":8,"depth":120}},{"id":"shop_grocer","kind":"shop","label":"a shop","color":"#7b6f63","size":1,"pos":[-10,0,-4],"yaw":90,"detail":{"text":"GROCER","second":"#c9a86a"}},{"id":"shop_baker","kind":"shop","label":"a shop","color":"#6e6a72","size":1,"pos":[-10,0,7],"yaw":90,"detail":{"text":"BAKERY","second":"#d0b884"}},{"id":"shop_hardware","kind":"shop","label":"a shop","color":"#77685f","size":1,"pos":[10,0,8],"yaw":270,"detail":{"text":"HARDWARE","second":"#b8a878"}},{"id":"house_corner","kind":"house","label":"","color":"#6c6660","size":1,"pos":[10,0,-2],"yaw":270},{"id":"house_far","kind":"house","label":"","color":"#63605e","size":1,"pos":[-10,0,-16],"yaw":90},{"id":"lamp_1","kind":"lamp","label":"a street lamp","color":"#3e4148","size":1,"pos":[-5.2,0,-12],"yaw":90,"glow":true,"detail":{"height":4.5}},{"id":"lamp_2","kind":"lamp","label":"a street lamp","color":"#3e4148","size":1,"pos":[-5.2,0,2],"yaw":90,"glow":true,"detail":{"height":4.5}},{"id":"lamp_3","kind":"lamp","label":"a street lamp","color":"#3e4148","size":1,"pos":[5.2,0,-4],"yaw":270,"glow":true,"detail":{"height":4.5}},{"id":"lamp_4","kind":"lamp","label":"a street lamp","color":"#3e4148","size":1,"pos":[5.2,0,12],"yaw":270,"glow":true,"detail":{"height":4.5}}],"beats":[{"dur":7,"text":"I'm on an almost-empty street in a small town.","camera":{"mode":"wide","target":"me","distance":22,"height":7,"angle":200},"actions":[{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"idle"}]},{"dur":7,"text":"There are shops, etc., and street lamps.","camera":{"mode":"fixed","target":"me","pos":[13,9,-16],"lookAt":[0,1,0]},"actions":[{"actor":"me","state":"idle"}]},{"dur":12,"text":"I'm walking down the street, about to turn a corner,","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":8,"height":3,"angle":180},"actions":[{"actor":"me","move":[0,0,10],"path":"line","yaw":0,"state":"walk"}]},{"dur":6,"text":"and I'm confronted by a loud man in a raincoat","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":8,"height":3,"angle":110},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","at":0.1,"for":0.25,"yaw":180,"state":"idle","appear":true},{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"idle"},{"effect":"pulse","at":0.12}]},{"dur":7,"text":"- he's really mad about something but I don't know what.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"man_raincoat","distance":6,"height":2.5,"angle":45},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","state":"yell"},{"actor":"me","state":"idle"}]},{"dur":9,"text":"He just stands and yells at me, sometimes shoving with his elbow and shoulder","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":7,"height":2.5,"angle":90},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","for":0.45,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"man_raincoat","at":0.45,"for":0.3,"state":"push"},{"actor":"man_raincoat","at":0.75,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"idle"},{"effect":"quake","at":0.5}]},{"dur":6,"text":"- he's got his hands stuck in his pockets.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"man_raincoat","distance":5.5,"height":2.2,"angle":30},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","state":"pockets"},{"actor":"me","state":"idle"}]},{"dur":9,"text":"I retreat up the street a bit - there are some people out watching.","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":9,"height":3.2,"angle":90},"actions":[{"actor":"me","move":[0,0,2],"path":"line","yaw":0,"state":"walk"},{"actor":"watchers","at":0.12,"for":0.25,"yaw":285,"state":"idle","appear":true},{"actor":"man_raincoat","state":"yell"}]},{"dur":6,"text":"I guess they think I had something to do with this guy.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"watchers","distance":9,"height":3.5,"angle":0},"actions":[{"actor":"watchers","yaw":285,"state":"idle"},{"actor":"me","state":"idle"},{"actor":"man_raincoat","state":"yell"}]},{"dur":10,"text":"He follows and keeps yelling at me","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":9,"height":3,"angle":90},"actions":[{"actor":"me","move":[0,0,-4],"path":"line","yaw":0,"state":"walk"},{"actor":"man_raincoat","move":[0,0,-2.6],"path":"line","yaw":180,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"watchers","yaw":260,"state":"idle"}]},{"dur":8,"text":"- some of the time he yells around in general but it's mostly at me","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"man_raincoat","distance":6,"height":2.5,"angle":50},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","for":0.4,"yaw":230,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"man_raincoat","at":0.45,"yaw":180,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"idle"}]},{"dur":11,"text":"- I don't know him and definitely didn't do anything to start this, it seems he's just picked me because I'm handy.","camera":{"mode":"wide","target":"me","distance":24,"height":8,"angle":60},"actions":[{"actor":"man_raincoat","state":"yell"},{"actor":"me","state":"idle"},{"actor":"watchers","yaw":260,"state":"idle"},{"world":{"skyColor":"#4a4f66","fogColor":"#5c60